      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ETo make a tarte of Hippes\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nTAKE Hippes, slit them, and pick out the kernels: then seeth them in white wine, or in faire water, when they bee soft sodden, straine them as thick as you can, and season them with Synamon, ginger \u0026 sugar, and lay it in paste.\u003Cbr\u003E"
